ES:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}¡Ay, hola, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¿Cómo te va?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}¿Ya estás de pie y como si nada
con la que cae esta mañana?{{TAG:000A:000B:100D000E00CD}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Hey, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Tagchen! {{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Selbst der Regen kann dir nicht
die Laune vermiesen, hm?{{TAG:000A:000B:100D000E00CD}}

{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Wenn das mal nicht {{TAG:0005:0008:}} ist!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Bist wohl gerade aus dem Zug
gefallen, was? 
Die Sonne hat sich zwar verkrümelt,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
aber wer lässt sich davon den Tag
vermiesen?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0003:0021:}}Wir nicht, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Şuna bak, {{TAG:0005:0008:}} gelmiş!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Daha yeni mi geldin?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
Güneş bugün saklanmış gibi ama sen yine de
kendini evinde hisset, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Oh, it's the rainmaker!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Keeping your spirits up on a day 
like this?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} You're just fantastic!{{TAG:000A:000B:100F001000CD}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Vaya, qué coincidencia, vienes tú, ¡y
diluvia!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0003:0026:}}Pero no seré malpensada,
¿eh?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ¡Venga, vamos a pasarlo bien!{{TAG:000A:000B:100F001000CD}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Aa, yağmur getiren kişi gelmiş!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Böyle bir günde bile moralin yüksek mi?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Sen gerçekten müthişsin!{{TAG:000A:000B:100F001000CD}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Well, if it isn't {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
When'd you get here?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Everyone in {{TAG:0005:0005:}} is getting
soaked in this rain, so stay strong!{{TAG:000A:000B:1011001200CD}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Caray, ¡pero si eres tú, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
¿Desde cuándo andas por aquí?
¿Y cómo te ha dado por ahí?
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Ya ves que aquí en {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0005:}}
llueve a cántaros, pero que no te
afecte mucho, ¿eh?{{TAG:000A:000B:1011001200CD}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Hey, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}, altes Haus!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Wo kommst du denn her?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Dank des Regens gibt es in ganz
{{TAG:0005:0005:}} kein trockenes Paar
Socken mehr! {{TAG:000A:000B:1011001200CD}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Şuna bak, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Ne zaman geldin?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}
{{TAG:0005:0005:}}'daki herkes bu yağmurda
sırılsıklam oluyor, sen güçlü kal!{{TAG:000A:000B:1011001200CD}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Ehi, sei proprio tu,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?!
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Da quanto sei qui? {{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}Mi sembra
di capire che ti piace la pioggia!{{TAG:000A:000B:1013001400CD}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Huch!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Ach, du bist's, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Machst du 'nen Spaziergang?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Und dafür ist dir kein besserer Tag
als dieser Regentag eingefallen?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Na, wenn du meinst, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}But you're not gonna out-spirit me!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Something about the rain, man. It
powers me up, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Remarque, j'en serais capable, moi !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
La pluie, c'est mon péché mignon !
Tombe, pluie, tombe,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Ama enerji konusunda beni geçemezsin!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Yağmurda bir şey var, dostum. Beni
resmen şarj ediyor, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Guess I can learn a bit from you.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
I shouldn't get all mopey just 'cause
of a little rain! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Forse dovrei seguire il tuo esempio.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Non dovrei deprimermi per qualche
goccia di pioggia! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Galiba senden biraz ders alabilirim.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Biraz yağmur var diye surat
asmamalıyım! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Getting cold and wet in the dark...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Man, it's hard to have a good time
on a rainy night, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Prendere freddo e acqua di notte...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Accidenti se è difficile farsi piacere
una cosa così, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}¡Ji, ji! Lo entiendo perfectamente.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
¡Yo es que me siento requetebién
cuando llueve,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Eh! Come ti capisco.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} La pioggia
fa andare su di giri anche me!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}You gotta be half frog or something
to enjoy a rainy night like this!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Sheesh!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Böyle yağmurlu geceden keyif almak
için yarı kurbağa falan olman lazım!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Yahu!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
